  <!--
    Olympic Knight.

    An order of thirteen Golds who answer to the Compact rather than to the
    Sovereign, and are held to be the best warriors alive. After the Second Moon
    Lord Rebellion the order split in two, one branch for the Core and one for the
    Rim, so BOTH the Society and the Rim Dominion field them - hence this kind
    appearing in both factions' group makers.

    The knighthoods themselves - Morning, Rage, Storm, Fear, Death and the rest -
    are titles held by one person at a time, not a pawn type. They are recorded in
    docs/DESIGN.md for Milestone 5; see the note there on Royalty titles versus
    Ideology roles.

    This is the strongest human pawn in the mod. combatPower 340 puts one knight
    above a full Society squad, which is the intent: a raid containing one is a
    different kind of problem.
  -->
  <PawnKindDef ParentName="RR_SocietyFighterBase">
    <defName>RR_Society_OlympicKnight</defName>
    <label>olympic knight</label>
    <initialResistanceRange>38~58</initialResistanceRange>
