  <!--
    White, Blue, Violet and Pink existed as xenotypes but could never spawn.

    EVERY pawn kind in this file sets useFactionXenotypes false and pins its own
    Color, which means a FactionDef's xenotypeSet is never consulted for any of
    them - those carefully weighted faction tables were dead data. A Color with no
    pawn kind therefore appears nowhere at all, and nothing says so: the xenotype
    loads, the faction lists it, and no pawn is ever made from it.

